ɑ́ɑ́ nsɑ̃́ɑ̃̀ kɛ tú ɑ yètìrì ndɛu.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"N tú osénnìwè nwe, ocĩ̀rì,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Kuyie mmɔ́nnɛ́ní kɛ́ n tee.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Fɔ̃́ɔ̃̀ tu n teentì n dɛɛtíwè.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"N Yiɛ̀ nKuyie mbɑ́ɑ́ ɔɔtɛ!","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/tbz_sim/PSA/70.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/tbz_sim/PSA/71.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/tbz_sim/PSA/69.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}